"""
daily_sr.py — Daily OHLC + S/R chart for a single ticker.

Applies the 10-step price-action framework:
  1. Phase detection (uptrend / downtrend_active / base_building / breakdown)
  2. Framework selection (S/R ladder trading vs trend-following)
  3. Support ladder
  4. Resistance ladder
  5. Position + recent K-line behavior
  6. Bias synthesis (short / mid / long)
  7. Scenario tree (If-Then)
  8. Common misjudgments rejected
  9. Final synthesis
  10. Methodology footer

Outputs:
  --out PNG     : the chart
  stdout JSON   : the structured snapshot for downstream LLM narrative

Usage:
  python3 daily_sr.py --ticker 09992.HK --out ./09992.png
  python3 daily_sr.py -t AAPL -o /tmp/aapl.png --days 250
"""
